        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Each member of the unit who works at a medical center hospital or clinic who is not working on an academic calendar as established by the University shall receive one (1) personal holiday in lieu of the administrative holiday mentioned in Section A, above. Employees in units that close on the designated administrative holiday are not eligible for the personal holiday. Eligibility for and use of the personal holiday is provided when:",
